            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntivyari bikwiye ko ndinda kubandikira mwebwe abizera ivyerekeye iki gikorwa co gutanga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko ndazi inyota mufise yo gufasha. Namye ndavyirata kw’ishengero ry’i Makedoniya, ndababwira ko kuva mu mwaka uheze mwebwe abo muri Akaya mwari mwamaze kuvyitegurira, kandi ishaka ryanyu ni ryo ryatumye benshi bo mw’ishengero ry’i Makedoniya batangura gutanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko ndungitse abo bene Data kugira ngo menye neza ko mwiteguye nk’uko nababwiye, kandi kugira mwegeranye imfashanyo zanyu. Sinshaka ko ivyirato vyanje ku bwanyu vyoba ivy’ubusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko hamwe hogira ab’i Makedoniya tuzanana hanyuma bagasanga mutiteguye, twomaramara, ariko mwebwe mwomaramara kurusha kuko mwabivuganye ugushira amanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni co gituma nabonye ko ari nkenerwa kwinginga bene Data ngo babagendere imbere yuko nza kugira ngo batunganye neza ico gikorwa co gutanga mwiyemeje. Mubitegure nk’igikorwa kivuye mu rukundo, atari ico musunikiwemwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwibuke bene Data: ababiba bike bimbura bike, kandi ababiba vyinshi bimbura vyinshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuntu wese atange ikivuye ku mutima. Ntimupfe gutanga canke ngo mutange kuko mubitegetswe, kuko Imana ikunda uwutangana umunezero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imana irashoboye kubuzuza ubuntu bwayo kugira ngo muri vyose na hose muronke ivyo mukeneye, mugire n’ibisagutse bituma mukora igikorwa ciza cose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nk’uko Ivyanditswe bibivuga:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ico gikorwa ntikizofasha mu kuronsa abera ivyo bakeneye gusa, ariko kizotuma kandi bahimbaza Imana n’umunezero mwinshi muriko muragikora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubera igikorwa mukora, bazohimbaza Imana kubera ukwumvira kwanyu guherekeza Ubutumwa Bwiza bwa Kristo muvuga, n’umutima w’urukundo mwerekana mu kubafasha no mu gufasha n’abandi na bo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi bazobasengera n’umutima w’urukundo, kubera ubuntu busesekaye Imana yabagiriye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imana ishimwe ku bw’iyi ngabire yayo y’akaburarugero!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
